prov:Activity a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "One call an agent made to a language model, as the agent reports it (docs/specs/disclosure.md). model_id is the model the provider's response named, which may be more exact than the one configured. prompt_digest identifies the messages sent: the harness keeps them beside the run, never in the envelope, and checks that they hash to it. model_account says whose account paid for the call, never whose key, and model_declared the model the agent's card declared, when the profile's model map routed the call to another (docs/specs/model-accounts.md)." ;
	sh:closed true ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n242 ;
	sh:property _:c14n113 , _:c14n178 , _:c14n245 , _:c14n262 , _:c14n534 , _:c14n555 , _:c14n587 , _:c14n65 ;
	sh:targetClass prov:Activity .
prov:Agent a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "The human an invocation acted for (Blueprint §5.4), or the accountable human role where it acted for an institution. Named by the deployment's authentication boundary and recorded by the conductor; a request cannot name one, and an agent is never sent one (docs/specs/policy-and-identity.md)." ;
	sh:closed true ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n8 ;
	sh:property _:c14n157 , _:c14n181 , _:c14n212 , _:c14n338 , _:c14n443 ;
	sh:targetClass prov:Agent .
dd:Affiliation a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "One affiliation on an ORCID record: an employment, an education or another kind, with the organisation and, where ORCID gives one, its identifier (ROR, GRID, Ringgold)." ;
	sh:closed true ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n407 ;
	sh:property _:c14n119 , _:c14n158 , _:c14n339 , _:c14n342 , _:c14n35 , _:c14n41 , _:c14n428 , _:c14n491 , _:c14n94 ;
	sh:targetClass dd:Affiliation .
dd:ApprovedMetadataRecord a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "The project's metadata record as a person approved it: the version named by the last approval of a metadata_record document in the project (docs/specs/projects.md). A drafter treats what it holds as supplied, given by a person (docs/specs/drafting.md)." ;
	sh:closed true ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n0 ;
	sh:property _:c14n216 , _:c14n37 , _:c14n493 , _:c14n545 ;
	sh:targetClass dd:ApprovedMetadataRecord .
dd:CategoryCount a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "One category of a field and how many rows hold it, rounded." ;
	sh:closed true ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n502 ;
	sh:property _:c14n188 , _:c14n97 ;
	sh:targetClass dd:CategoryCount .
dd:ChoiceOption a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "One option of a choice question (a Question of kind choice)." ;
	sh:closed true ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n298 ;
	sh:property _:c14n316 , _:c14n448 , _:c14n506 ;
	sh:targetClass dd:ChoiceOption .
dd:ChosenRepository a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "The repository a researcher chose to deposit the project's data in, from the shortlist, by the identifier of the registry that lists it: the conductor fills it into a Message, and into the input of an agent that mixes in GivenProjectRepository, so that the agent knows a repository is chosen and which (docs/specs/projects.md). The last choice stands until a researcher chooses again." ;
	sh:closed true ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n560 ;
	sh:property _:c14n282 , _:c14n285 , _:c14n519 ;
	sh:targetClass dd:ChosenRepository .
dd:ConversationTurn a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "One earlier turn of a conversation, as the caller presents it to the agent. An agent turn names the agent and version that produced it and the invocation it came from." ;
	sh:closed true ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n126 ;
	sh:property _:c14n2 , _:c14n20 , _:c14n33 , _:c14n352 , _:c14n461 ;
	sh:targetClass dd:ConversationTurn .
dd:CurrentVersion a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "The version of a project document that a drafter is to regenerate: the document's latest, its text, and its state with the reason a person gave for any decision on it (ADR-0036 decision 7). A drafter that regenerates it names version_ref in its payload's revises. When the request asks for a revision, it also holds the change a person asked for." ;
	sh:closed true ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n161 ;
	sh:property _:c14n122 , _:c14n21 , _:c14n458 , _:c14n46 , _:c14n474 , _:c14n492 , _:c14n530 ;
	sh:targetClass dd:CurrentVersion .
dd:Delegation a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "One child invocation an agent in grounding mode delegation made through the harness (docs/specs/orchestration.md). Recorded by the conductor from its own run of the child, never reported by the agent. content_hash is the dd-envelope-json-v1 hash of the child envelope, which is what a relayed reply cites." ;
	sh:closed true ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n13 ;
	sh:property _:c14n162 , _:c14n325 , _:c14n363 , _:c14n422 , _:c14n51 ;
	sh:targetClass dd:Delegation .
dd:DepositConnector a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "An override only: how the harness deposits a draft to the repository through its API (docs/specs/deposit.md, Depositing through an API). It holds no credential: each researcher deposits with their own, held outside the app and the harness." ;
	sh:closed true ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n144 ;
	sh:property _:c14n107 , _:c14n354 , _:c14n421 , _:c14n435 , _:c14n59 ;
	sh:targetClass dd:DepositConnector .
dd:DisclosureCheck a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "What the disclosure check of a field's summary values did: the rules, their parameters, the tool and how many values it left out, never which (docs/specs/personal-data.md)." ;
	sh:closed true ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n524 ;
	sh:property _:c14n258 , _:c14n260 , _:c14n264 , _:c14n319 , _:c14n526 , _:c14n578 ;
	sh:targetClass dd:DisclosureCheck .
dd:Document a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "The payload of an agent that drafts or regenerates a project document: a metadata record, a README, a data dictionary or another document, as text (docs/specs/projects.md). The only payload class that becomes a project document." ;
	sh:closed true ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n283 ;
	sh:property _:c14n121 , _:c14n134 , _:c14n213 , _:c14n365 , _:c14n371 , _:c14n403 , _:c14n418 , _:c14n451 , _:c14n454 , _:c14n471 , _:c14n477 ;
	sh:targetClass dd:Document .
dd:DocumentQuestion a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "A question a drafter asks the researcher about one gap in the version it drafted: a README section it could not write, a data dictionary cell it could not fill, or a metadata record property it left null. The target is either gap_section, with gap_part when the section is asked part by part, or gap_file, gap_field and gap_column together, or gap_property alone. A cell question about a column that several files share, by name, type and format, also lists in gap_files every file whose cell the answer fills. question_id is derived from the target, so it is the same in every version that leaves the same gap (docs/specs/drafting.md). A question may offer a suggested_answer, with how it was derived (suggestion_derivation); a suggestion is never placed in the document, and becomes supplied only when a person records it as their answer. A question that asks for a value every kind of document gives the same way names it in shared_field; a suggestion copied from a person's own answer or decision elsewhere in the project says where, in suggested_from." ;
	sh:closed true ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n517 ;
	sh:property _:c14n111 , _:c14n15 , _:c14n160 , _:c14n219 , _:c14n273 , _:c14n294 , _:c14n329 , _:c14n408 , _:c14n409 , _:c14n455 , _:c14n564 , _:c14n93 , _:c14n99 ;
	sh:targetClass dd:DocumentQuestion .
dd:DocumentVersionRef a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "One version of a project document: the document the conductor minted an identifier for, and the version's number within it, counted from 1." ;
	sh:closed true ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n556 ;
	sh:property _:c14n297 , _:c14n69 ;
	sh:targetClass dd:DocumentVersionRef .
dd:DocumentationSummary a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "What one document a researcher attached to a project is, without its text: the conductor fills one per document into a Message so that the agent knows the project holds it (docs/specs/projects.md)." ;
	sh:closed true ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n234 ;
	sh:property _:c14n131 , _:c14n197 , _:c14n301 , _:c14n349 , _:c14n387 , _:c14n423 , _:c14n440 ;
	sh:targetClass dd:DocumentationSummary .
dd:DraftAnswer a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "A person's answer to one question a version of the document asked (DocumentQuestion). The drafter places answer_text, as given, in the gap or cell the question names and marks it supplied (docs/specs/drafting.md)." ;
	sh:closed true ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n90 ;
	sh:property _:c14n398 , _:c14n496 ;
	sh:targetClass dd:DraftAnswer .
dd:DraftRequest a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "What a drafter is asked for: a project document of one kind, drafted from the project's facts (docs/specs/projects.md). Every agent that returns a Document accepts it, so an agent that drafts a document can replace another without its caller changing. The project's facts are the inventory, the requirements of the repository chosen, the metadata record a person approved last and, to regenerate a document, its current version with any decision on it. In a project, the conductor puts the inventory, the requirements and the metadata record in from the project, replacing whatever the caller sent, so a caller leaves them out; outside a project, the caller sends them. In a project the conductor also fills current_version, the latest version of the project's document of that kind, or of the document redraft_document names, so a redraft is that document's next version. The answers a person recorded to the current version's questions are filled in by the conductor in the same way (docs/specs/drafting.md), and so are the researcher facts people in the project chose to keep from their public ORCID records (docs/specs/projects.md), and the text of the documents a researcher attached to the project, from which a drafter's model may suggest answers but never fill a gap. The conductor also fills shared_answers: the latest answer a person recorded, for a document of another kind, to a question that asks for the same thing as one of this draft's (shared_field), which a drafter may offer as a suggestion but never place. With revise, the drafter is asked to revise the current version as a person asked, in their words, and the conductor gives the current version the change they asked for (revision_request)." ;
	sh:closed true ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n75 ;
	sh:property _:c14n101 , _:c14n179 , _:c14n200 , _:c14n348 , _:c14n366 , _:c14n400 , _:c14n417 , _:c14n45 , _:c14n483 , _:c14n500 , _:c14n54 , _:c14n565 , _:c14n79 ;
	sh:targetClass dd:DraftRequest .
dd:DraftSummary a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "The latest version of one document drafted in a project, without its text: the conductor fills one per document into a Message so that the agent knows which version is current and whether it was drafted from the inventory the project holds now, rather than relying on what it said of an earlier version (docs/specs/projects.md)." ;
	sh:closed true ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n120 ;
	sh:property _:c14n109 , _:c14n223 , _:c14n310 , _:c14n40 ;
	sh:targetClass dd:DraftSummary .
dd:Envelope a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "The agent's response. Every field an agent did not decide (identifiers, timestamps, telemetry, the policy applied, the human it acted for) is filled by the conductor, so an agent cannot mislabel its own run. Conditional rules not expressible in JSON Schema are enforced by contract.validate: failed or suspended requires problem; abstained or referred requires outcome.reason_code; succeeded requires payload; a payload requires payload_schema, and payload_schema a payload." ;
	sh:closed true ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n168 ;
	sh:property _:c14n110 , _:c14n145 , _:c14n204 , _:c14n22 , _:c14n225 , _:c14n238 , _:c14n239 , _:c14n261 , _:c14n341 , _:c14n396 , _:c14n405 , _:c14n441 , _:c14n442 , _:c14n47 , _:c14n497 , _:c14n535 , _:c14n539 , _:c14n553 , _:c14n60 , _:c14n64 , _:c14n89 , _:c14n9 ;
	sh:targetClass dd:Envelope .
dd:EvidenceItem a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "The retrieved content a grounding claim rests on, identified by a hash over its canonicalised projection (not the HTTP body)." ;
	sh:closed true ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n358 ;
	sh:property _:c14n153 , _:c14n177 , _:c14n189 , _:c14n240 , _:c14n32 , _:c14n397 , _:c14n436 , _:c14n88 ;
	sh:targetClass dd:EvidenceItem .
dd:ExternalIdentifier a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "An identifier from another scheme, as an ORCID record gives it: for a researcher, such as a Scopus Author ID; for a work, such as a DOI." ;
	sh:closed true ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n82 ;
	sh:property _:c14n359 , _:c14n460 , _:c14n58 ;
	sh:targetClass dd:ExternalIdentifier .
dd:FieldSummary a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "Summary values of one table field that the inventory command computed where the data live and passed through statistical disclosure control before writing (docs/specs/personal-data.md). A value that failed a rule is absent, never altered to pass; every count is at least the check's threshold and rounded to its base, and a range is never the raw minimum and maximum." ;
	sh:closed true ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n438 ;
	sh:property _:c14n229 , _:c14n290 , _:c14n330 , _:c14n406 , _:c14n433 , _:c14n495 , _:c14n546 ;
	sh:targetClass dd:FieldSummary .
dd:FileInventory a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "The facts about a dataset's files that the project holds in place of the files (docs/specs/projects.md): for each file its path, size, digest and format, and for a table its fields. Made by a command run where the data live; it never contains a file's content. advisor.files reads it." ;
	sh:closed true ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n63 ;
	sh:property _:c14n114 , _:c14n292 , _:c14n315 , _:c14n449 , _:c14n459 , _:c14n479 , _:c14n528 , _:c14n532 , _:c14n575 ;
	sh:targetClass dd:FileInventory .
dd:GivenInstitutionRepositories a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "Mixed into an agent's own input class when the agent reads the repositories the deployment's profile names as its institution's. The conductor fills institution_repositories by this name from the profile, in a project or not, and never needs to know the input class; whatever a caller sent there is replaced." ;
	sh:closed false ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n415 ;
	sh:property _:c14n351 ;
	sh:targetClass dd:GivenInstitutionRepositories .
dd:GivenProjectDecisions a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "Mixed into an agent's own input class when the agent reads the facts people decided about the project. In a project the conductor fills project_decisions by this name, as for a DraftRequest, and never needs to know the input class (docs/specs/projects.md, invariant 6); outside one, the caller sends them." ;
	sh:closed false ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n542 ;
	sh:property _:c14n205 ;
	sh:targetClass dd:GivenProjectDecisions .
dd:GivenProjectDocuments a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "Mixed into an agent's own input class when the agent reads the documents a researcher attached to the project. In a project the conductor fills project_documents by this name, as for a DraftRequest, and never needs to know the input class (docs/specs/projects.md, invariant 6); outside one, the caller sends them." ;
	sh:closed false ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n324 ;
	sh:property _:c14n19 ;
	sh:targetClass dd:GivenProjectDocuments .
dd:GivenProjectMetadataRecord a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "Mixed into an agent's own input class when the agent reads the project's metadata record: its latest version, whatever its state, and the version a person approved last. In a project the conductor fills project_metadata_draft and project_metadata_approved by these names and never needs to know the input class (docs/specs/projects.md, invariant 6); outside one, the caller sends them." ;
