dd:GivenProjectRepository a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "Mixed into an agent's own input class when the agent reads the repository a researcher chose for the project. In a project the conductor fills project_repository by this name and never needs to know the input class (docs/specs/projects.md, invariant 6); outside one, the caller sends it." ;
	sh:closed false ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n192 ;
	sh:property _:c14n53 ;
	sh:targetClass dd:GivenProjectRepository .
dd:Grounded a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "Mixed into every payload class and every item class that asserts an identity. The linter walks a payload document for grounded_on lists and never needs to know the payload class; a payload that lacks grounded_on at its root is a violation, not a pass." ;
	sh:closed false ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n412 ;
	sh:property _:c14n289 ;
	sh:targetClass dd:Grounded .
dd:GroundingRef a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "The identity and content hash of one retrieved thing a payload rests on. The only way a payload may name an external resource as a decided identity, and the only place it names it: what the reference identifies is read from the evidence item with the same source_id and content_hash (docs/specs/grounding.md). The linter matches every GroundingRef against a retrieval span on both fields." ;
	sh:closed true ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n516 ;
	sh:property _:c14n4 , _:c14n49 ;
	sh:targetClass dd:GroundingRef .
dd:Input a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "Any input: an object that names its class in schema_class. The core checks nothing else; the class schema of the agent's accepted input class does (docs/specs/contract.md)." ;
	sh:closed false ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n81 ;
	sh:property _:c14n96 ;
	sh:targetClass dd:Input .
dd:InstitutionRepository a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "One repository the deployment's profile names as its institution's (the profile's institution_repositories, docs/specs/policy-and-identity.md). It names a registry's record by repository_id and adds only what the deployment vouches for that no registry holds: the conductor fills it into the input of an agent that mixes in GivenInstitutionRepositories." ;
	sh:closed true ;
