	sh:targetClass dd:InvocationRequest .
dd:Message a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "One conversational turn addressed to an agent: the text of the turn and the conversation so far. The history is part of the input, so the input hash covers everything the agent saw. In a project that holds an inventory, the conductor adds what it is (docs/specs/projects.md); in any project, it adds the entry point chosen, the progress the project log shows and the project's title, if it has one (docs/specs/orchestration.md). It adds the researcher facts people in the project chose to keep from their public ORCID records, the facts they decided, the repository they chose and the latest version of each document drafted in it (docs/specs/projects.md)." ;
