	sh:targetClass dd:ProblemDetails .
dd:ProjectDocument a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "One document a researcher attached to a project, with its text: the conductor fills one per document into a DraftRequest so that a drafter's model may suggest answers from it (docs/specs/projects.md). Its text is the researcher's, untrusted, and given as data." ;
